# A macro plays through even if the button is let go early, and releases what it still holds.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/layers.padpack Base
press north
advance 20
release north
advance 400
---
key KEY_1 down         @0
key KEY_1 up           @30
key KEY_2 down         @81
key KEY_2 up           @111
key KEY_LEFTSHIFT down @111
key KEY_3 down         @111
key KEY_3 up           @141
key KEY_LEFTSHIFT up   @141
